WEBVTT

00:37.920 --> 00:39.960
"Soon, we'll be studying together."

00:41.280 --> 00:42.360
I'll be waiting.

00:59.800 --> 01:04.760
Love in school, the all-time problem.

01:08.520 --> 01:11.400
Do the adults forbid it,
because of goodwill…

01:14.440 --> 01:16.560
or do they just fear to accept the truth?

02:56.560 --> 03:01.120
GIRLS' UNIFORM OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL

03:01.200 --> 03:05.760
THE CORRECT WAY OF PAYING RESPECT
OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL

03:10.520 --> 03:14.080
A GRACEFUL, TRADITIONAL LADY
IS A NATIONAL TREASURE

03:14.160 --> 03:17.760
THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL

03:17.840 --> 03:21.120
Headmaster, you can't take down our school
and merge it with the boys's.

03:26.360 --> 03:31.400
There's no other choice, Ms. Naruemol.
Our school is running short of money.

03:32.640 --> 03:36.800
Our school is always well-known for
producing graceful, traditional ladies,

03:36.880 --> 03:40.680
and all of the sudden, you're going to let
those naughty boys, who are like flies,

03:40.760 --> 03:43.200
defile our school.

03:44.440 --> 03:49.280
It can be pure, but I've got
no money to pay for your salary.

03:50.160 --> 03:51.280
Can you take that?

03:52.840 --> 03:55.120
These boys are like termites.

03:55.760 --> 03:57.600
If they get to bite our home,

03:58.120 --> 03:59.400
they will never stop.

04:00.880 --> 04:03.600
And what about all the virtues
that we've gathered all these times?

04:03.680 --> 04:06.000
All of it will perish.

04:07.720 --> 04:09.080
Perish?

04:11.360 --> 04:14.400
So what do you want them to be,
flies or termites?

04:19.200 --> 04:20.560
Here.

04:20.640 --> 04:24.079
These are the notes
the boys sent to our girls.

04:24.839 --> 04:26.160
I can't stand it any longer.

04:28.480 --> 04:29.680
Oh, my.

04:31.560 --> 04:34.400
These kids are much more outdated
than I thought.

04:35.040 --> 04:37.000
You know, back in my days,

04:37.560 --> 04:39.160
it was a lot more than this.

04:41.640 --> 04:43.560
No. It's an absolute no.

04:46.840 --> 04:49.200
I know that you love
this school very much…

04:50.440 --> 04:55.160
but Ms. Naruemol, you're forgetting that
I don't need to ask for your permission.

04:56.600 --> 04:57.800
The reason I have you here is

04:58.480 --> 05:02.120
I want you,
the head of the Administrative Department,

05:02.200 --> 05:04.160
to come up with the policies

05:04.680 --> 05:07.080
to help the students know

05:07.160 --> 05:10.280
how to handle the upcoming changes.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.760
Let it be a little defiled

05:16.840 --> 05:19.960
in order to get more money
and for the school to go on.

05:20.960 --> 05:22.040
Is that clear?

05:24.440 --> 05:29.600
I'm going to be frank here.
I feel very hopeless with this decision.

05:30.720 --> 05:36.080
The headmaster seems like he's opening
the gate for the enemies to conquer us.

05:36.160 --> 05:39.800
But I think it won't cause
much trouble, will it?

05:39.880 --> 05:44.160
Anyhow, our girls
will see the boys, eventually.

05:44.240 --> 05:46.280
But it's not supposed to be today.

05:48.640 --> 05:52.040
At this age, it's the time for blooming.

05:52.960 --> 05:56.600
Like blossoms,
which are blooming beautifully.

05:58.880 --> 06:03.040
We must nurture them
and take the best care of them.

06:04.160 --> 06:06.040
Because it's the time
that they're fragile.

06:07.280 --> 06:09.160
It's a risk to get distracted easily.

06:09.960 --> 06:12.840
And the boys too.
It's the time that they're intimidating.

06:12.920 --> 06:16.600
No maturity, no responsibility.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.200
It's really risky.

06:19.280 --> 06:22.440
They might bring our girls down
to their level.

06:22.960 --> 06:25.280
I agree with you, Ms. Naruemol.

06:25.360 --> 06:27.680
We must live by our school's honor.

06:28.280 --> 06:30.560
If we all don't see it
as a mutual problem,

06:30.640 --> 06:32.480
we won't be able to get past it.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.560
Well said, Ms. Linda.

06:37.960 --> 06:39.960
I've been in this school for so long.

06:40.040 --> 06:44.120
I know what a good school's standard is.

06:46.600 --> 06:51.880
I'd like to volunteer myself as a center
for everyone to get past this crisis.

06:52.720 --> 06:54.440
We all will not lose.

06:55.840 --> 06:58.720
I'll come up with the policy
and do everything

06:59.960 --> 07:03.120
for our school to overcome this crisis.

07:05.000 --> 07:09.720
Ms. Linda, you must be
one of the leaders too.

07:09.800 --> 07:11.320
It will be an honor.

07:12.560 --> 07:15.040
But we must start immediately.
Because right now,

07:15.120 --> 07:17.640
the students have already started
gossiping about the merger.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.840
That's terrible.

07:20.560 --> 07:22.680
It's not even officially announced yet.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.840
This is getting too far.

07:25.560 --> 07:27.440
Who was it? Who leaked the news?

07:29.200 --> 07:30.880
Hey, is it true that our school

07:30.960 --> 07:34.080
and the school next door
will merge as one, Nanno?

07:34.160 --> 07:35.080
That's true.

07:35.160 --> 07:36.880
Studying together with the boys?

07:36.960 --> 07:39.920
How? I won't know how to act.

07:40.480 --> 07:44.200
And what about if we're in PE class?
How will it be?

07:44.280 --> 07:46.680
And what if we need to go work
on an assignment at home?

07:46.760 --> 07:48.520
Just thinking about it stresses me out.

07:48.600 --> 07:52.040
No need to be stressed out.
The boys are nothing.

07:52.600 --> 07:53.480
Really?

07:54.360 --> 07:57.320
Yes. I used to study co-ed before.

07:57.400 --> 07:59.720
The boys aren't intimidating
like you've imagined.

07:59.800 --> 08:01.120
How so?

08:01.200 --> 08:03.360
Well, there was one time,

08:03.440 --> 08:06.920
the boys were sliding down
a stair railing,

08:07.000 --> 08:09.040
and I was the lookout.

08:09.120 --> 08:12.560
And when the teacher came,
everyone scattered.

08:12.640 --> 08:14.160
it was funny.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.240
That's funny.

08:18.160 --> 08:20.240
RULES OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NO. 012

08:20.320 --> 08:23.480
IT IS FORBIDDEN FOR THE GIRLS TO LAUGH
ALONG WITH THE BOYS' JOKES.

08:23.560 --> 08:25.040
IT IS NOT GRACEFUL.

08:25.120 --> 08:29.160
Do the girls here wear white shirts
with jailer collars?

08:29.240 --> 08:31.200
-They are sailor collars.
-They are sailor collars.

08:32.080 --> 08:33.240
Here they come.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.000
Shit.

08:39.919 --> 08:43.840
Hello. My name is Nanno.
It's nice meeting you.

08:44.320 --> 08:49.000
I'm Punjan.
And these are Pob, Man, and Yong.

08:49.600 --> 08:52.520
And these are Mind, Ploy and Kao.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.200
Nice to meet you.

08:58.280 --> 09:00.560
You spoke so quietly.
How could they hear you?

09:00.640 --> 09:02.240
Step a little closer.

09:04.000 --> 09:05.200
Boys don't bite.

09:11.240 --> 09:13.720
Actually, I'd like to give you
the school tour,

09:13.800 --> 09:15.960
but I am also a new student here.

09:16.040 --> 09:18.480
I should let the students
who've been here longer be your guide.

09:18.560 --> 09:20.280
But I don't think it's suitable, Nanno.

09:20.360 --> 09:23.000
I do remember traditional ladies

09:23.080 --> 09:25.000
must have friendly hearts.

09:27.120 --> 09:28.400
Right, Namnueng?

09:34.720 --> 09:36.320
Well, yes.

09:43.000 --> 09:45.320
Come on, I'll show you the rooms.

09:52.000 --> 09:53.680
This is the music room.

09:54.560 --> 09:57.080
If there's a music room,
is there also a lyrics room?

09:57.880 --> 10:01.440
You know how the music
and lyrics always come together.

10:05.040 --> 10:07.520
I've told you the boys are funny.

10:12.120 --> 10:13.280
Nanno.

10:14.760 --> 10:16.520
I'll take you to another room.

10:21.240 --> 10:23.160
This is the art room.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.680
-Art room?
-Yes.

10:24.760 --> 10:26.920
The one that's used for sewing?

10:27.000 --> 10:29.800
No. That's the sewing room.

10:29.880 --> 10:31.640
And how about this one?

10:31.720 --> 10:34.840
This one? Only girls are allowed.

10:34.920 --> 10:36.760
Boys aren't.

10:37.600 --> 10:39.080
They were all in a huddle.

10:39.600 --> 10:41.960
So what are we going to do next?

10:52.000 --> 10:53.640
I have my own way to deal with this.

11:02.200 --> 11:06.520
Today is the first day
that the boys will be studying with us.

11:07.760 --> 11:10.840
In order to have a proper class,

11:11.840 --> 11:14.720
I'd like to announce the rules
for everyone to comply with.

11:15.800 --> 11:19.240
This rule is called "Social Distancing."

11:20.000 --> 11:23.160
Keep a social distance
for the boys and the girls.

11:23.240 --> 11:25.000
Starting from the morning assembly,

11:25.080 --> 11:29.200
the boys and the girls
won't be joining the same line.

11:29.840 --> 11:32.680
The girls will line up
on my right-hand side,

11:33.200 --> 11:35.840
and the boys will line up
on my left-hand side,

11:36.480 --> 11:37.720
starting now.

11:48.120 --> 11:51.240
From now on, we'll separate the rooms,

11:54.720 --> 11:58.000
not only for the girls' school's honor,

11:58.960 --> 12:02.480
but also, for the boys
to grow up as gentlemen.

12:07.920 --> 12:11.160
Come on, faster.

12:12.520 --> 12:13.840
Faster.

12:21.440 --> 12:24.600
That's good. Keep running.
It's good exercise so you'll sweat,

12:24.680 --> 12:27.320
and you won't think about dirty stuff.

12:27.400 --> 12:28.480
Thank you.

12:32.320 --> 12:35.640
Iced chocolate and chocolate frappé
are forbidden

12:35.720 --> 12:37.920
because they will arouse
the students' sexual desires.

12:40.480 --> 12:43.080
RULES OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NO. 034

12:43.160 --> 12:45.000
IT IS FORBIDDEN FOR THE BOYS TO SAY
"MILK."

12:45.080 --> 12:47.360
INSTEAD, USE THE WORDS
"UHT DRINKS" OR "PASTEURIZED DRINKS."

12:48.720 --> 12:50.640
-I know.
-I'm exhausted.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.800
Do you think it's too much?

12:55.760 --> 12:57.680
Yes, a little too much.

12:58.280 --> 12:59.400
I feel sorry for them.

12:59.480 --> 13:02.320
Look at them, their hands are shaking
so much that they almost can't eat.

13:02.400 --> 13:03.400
Jeez.

13:11.960 --> 13:14.480
I'm so tired.

13:15.680 --> 13:16.920
What did he say?

13:27.520 --> 13:29.280
Pob said he's very tired.

13:30.960 --> 13:33.120
Wait, Nanno, you got his Line ID?

13:33.840 --> 13:36.200
Well, we're friends, that's why
we have each other's Line IDs.

13:37.920 --> 13:40.000
Do you want me to add you all
to the Line group?

13:40.520 --> 13:42.280
So you can talk to other people.

13:42.800 --> 13:44.720
-Of course.
-Sounds good.

13:49.880 --> 13:51.880
I already added you guys.
Accept the request.

13:51.960 --> 13:52.800
Okay.

13:52.880 --> 13:54.240
12:56 MIND JOINED THE GROUP
12:57 PLOY JOINED THE GROUP

13:54.320 --> 13:56.440
MIND: YOU ONLY EAT VEGETABLES?
I FEEL SORRY FOR YOU.

13:56.520 --> 13:58.040
YONG: IT'S NUTRITIOUS!

13:58.120 --> 13:59.840
NANNO: YOU WANT MORE NUTRITION?

13:59.920 --> 14:01.480
POB: CAN I? THEN CAN I ASK FOR MILK?

14:01.560 --> 14:02.840
NANNO: YES.

14:13.280 --> 14:15.600
POB: THANK YOU.

14:16.360 --> 14:18.080
You can't be on the phone
while having lunch.

14:18.160 --> 14:19.760
What's there to talk about?

14:32.480 --> 14:33.640
What's this?

14:34.200 --> 14:36.400
"Like you"?

14:36.480 --> 14:37.360
POB: LIKE YOU

14:37.440 --> 14:38.680
"Like you"?

14:39.160 --> 14:42.280
I think you should
read it again carefully.

14:42.360 --> 14:43.880
POB: LIKE YOU

14:43.960 --> 14:50.960
POB: THANK YOU

14:54.320 --> 14:55.400
Oh, dear.

14:55.480 --> 14:57.040
POB: CAN I? THEN CAN I ASK FOR MILK?

14:57.120 --> 14:58.240
"Ask for 'milk'?"

14:58.760 --> 15:00.520
See? Are you going to argue with me?

15:01.480 --> 15:03.680
He's asking for the school's milk.

15:03.760 --> 15:05.520
What did you think he meant?

15:10.960 --> 15:12.280
Can I ask for "milk"?

15:12.360 --> 15:13.200
Yes.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.800
-Wow.
-Wow.

15:17.640 --> 15:19.120
Like you.

15:23.840 --> 15:24.960
This must be taken care of.

15:25.040 --> 15:26.560
RULES OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NO. 041

15:26.640 --> 15:28.440
IT IS FORBIDDEN FOR THE BOYS AND THE GIRLS
TO CHAT WITH EACH OTHER.

15:28.520 --> 15:30.360
IF ANYONE GETS CAUGHT,
THEIR ACCOUNT WILL BE BLOCKED AT ONCE.

15:37.000 --> 15:38.840
What's wrong with the internet?

16:29.520 --> 16:31.160
When you get the pic developed,
I'll have one, please.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.120
Me too.

16:36.120 --> 16:36.960
Gosh.

16:37.840 --> 16:38.840
It's very chilly.

16:39.480 --> 16:41.080
So have you thought it through

16:41.160 --> 16:43.080
about what faculty you'll go to
after graduation?

16:46.440 --> 16:48.440
I want to get into
the Faculty of Education.

16:48.920 --> 16:52.240
I'll come back to be
a teacher in this school.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.120
Here?

16:54.200 --> 16:55.240
Yes.

16:55.320 --> 16:56.320
Wow.

16:57.600 --> 17:02.720
So the school must give the crown
to you, Naruemol,

17:02.800 --> 17:05.480
as "The Best Student."

17:05.560 --> 17:07.600
Thank you.

17:09.560 --> 17:12.119
-You must wipe your tears.
-Oh, right, brimming with tears.

17:13.880 --> 17:16.839
Yeah. But I think
you'll make a good teacher.

17:16.920 --> 17:19.240
THE EDUCATION OFFICE HAS AWARDED
THIS HONOR TO MISS NARUEMOL TRISIRIWIMOL

17:19.319 --> 17:20.319
AS THE BEST TEACHER OF 2019

17:38.000 --> 17:42.000
NAREUMOL: THANK YOU, MS. LINDA.
YOU MUST BE TIRED.

17:42.080 --> 17:44.960
LINDA: FOR MS. NAREUMOL,
I CAN ALWAYS DO IT.

17:45.040 --> 17:48.600
I'LL PICK YOU UP AT YOUR PLACE LIKE USUAL.

17:53.120 --> 17:54.520
RULES OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NO. 076

17:54.600 --> 17:56.880
IT IS FORBIDDEN TO SHOW ANY FEELINGS
TOWARD THE OPPOSITE SEX,

17:56.960 --> 17:58.600
NEITHER FACE TO FACE, ON THE PHONE,
NOR IN THOUGHT.

18:04.720 --> 18:06.920
Hey, Nanno, you can still talk to them?

18:07.000 --> 18:08.000
Of course.

18:09.320 --> 18:12.280
But I see that you're blocked too.

18:13.080 --> 18:14.480
I got a new application.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.480
New app?

18:16.560 --> 18:18.560
Yes. It's called "True Love."

18:18.640 --> 18:20.880
This application lets us
talk to other people in the school

18:20.960 --> 18:22.520
without revealing anything personal.

18:22.600 --> 18:25.160
So, teachers won't know
if we talk to the boys or the girls.

18:25.240 --> 18:29.760
Using this app, we might get true friends
or even a boyfriend.

18:30.960 --> 18:31.960
I see…

18:32.040 --> 18:35.720
so we only download it
and we can use it right away, right?

18:35.800 --> 18:39.200
Yes, just download it and you may start.

18:40.240 --> 18:42.960
This is interesting.
Let's download the app.

18:46.080 --> 18:47.040
CHOCOLATE FUDGE: ARE YOU THIS CUTE
IN PERSON?

18:47.120 --> 18:48.760
LEMON ALIEN: SO WHO ARE YOU REALLY?
GIVE ME A HINT!

18:48.840 --> 18:50.760
This is pretty exciting, don't you think?

18:50.840 --> 18:53.400
Well…I want to know
who the other person is.

18:54.040 --> 18:54.880
Right.

18:54.960 --> 18:57.080
SWEET APPLE: WERE YOU THE ONE
WHO STARED AT ME EARLIER?

18:57.160 --> 18:58.720
This is absurd.

18:59.840 --> 19:03.520
Are you the one who created
this shameful application?

19:03.600 --> 19:05.160
Shameful?

19:05.920 --> 19:07.480
What do you mean?

19:07.560 --> 19:10.200
This application is like blind dates,

19:10.280 --> 19:12.000
which is a place to mingle.

19:12.080 --> 19:14.800
No information. No identity.

19:14.880 --> 19:17.960
A place to mingle? We're just chatting.

19:18.440 --> 19:22.640
I think this app makes us
see the true identities of everyone.

19:22.720 --> 19:26.520
And it's useful, probably leading us
to meet true friends.

19:26.600 --> 19:27.800
Or…

19:28.880 --> 19:31.040
it could lead us to find true love.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.520
And what about you teachers?

19:34.600 --> 19:37.240
Did you have your first love
back in your school days?

19:37.320 --> 19:40.040
Hey! Do not interfere.

19:41.360 --> 19:44.600
Now, it's time for you to study,

19:45.160 --> 19:47.040
not the time to find love.

19:48.440 --> 19:52.680
Love will get you in big trouble.

19:54.280 --> 19:56.960
Some might lose their virginity.

19:57.760 --> 19:58.960
Some…

20:00.200 --> 20:02.080
might get pregnant during school.

20:05.640 --> 20:06.880
Well, that's true.

20:07.520 --> 20:12.640
If it gets out of control,
it must be really shameful.

20:13.960 --> 20:18.360
If you understand, you'll have to
completely delete this application.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.520
Delete it?

20:21.400 --> 20:25.840
But I think this app might come in handy
for the teachers.

20:26.360 --> 20:29.920
So you'll be able to keep an eye on
the ones that might get out of control.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.240
What do you mean?

20:39.520 --> 20:42.440
A hundred battles, a hundred victories.

20:43.200 --> 20:44.760
Know your enemy.

20:46.280 --> 20:51.200
I think you might want to have students
use this app as much as possible

20:52.240 --> 20:54.800
because this app
doesn't show any identity.

20:55.360 --> 20:57.000
And you may have forgotten

20:57.080 --> 21:01.120
that you have access
to their accounts and passwords.

21:01.200 --> 21:04.600
You can observe
what the students are talking about.

21:05.200 --> 21:08.680
Then you can go stop them
before anything gets out of control,

21:09.240 --> 21:11.000
all without getting hated by the students.

21:13.240 --> 21:14.800
But it's up to you.

21:15.360 --> 21:17.160
You may not want in.

21:18.360 --> 21:20.280
You may be afraid that once you're in,

21:20.360 --> 21:22.080
you may be the ones
who get out of control.

21:25.040 --> 21:28.320
But just by chatting, typing letters,

21:28.400 --> 21:30.000
it won't get anyone pregnant.

21:33.280 --> 21:34.240
Well, that's true.

21:36.320 --> 21:38.760
Then take care of it for me.

21:52.720 --> 21:55.120
EMPTY VASE

22:12.280 --> 22:15.040
EMPTY VASE: SOMETIMES, I GET SO TIRED
WITH WHAT I'VE PUT EFFORT IN

22:15.120 --> 22:17.960
AND NO ONE SEES THE IMPORTANCE.

22:19.320 --> 22:26.120
DAFFODIL: I'M WITH YOU. SOMETIMES,
YOU WANT THEM TO SEE THE IMPORTANCE.

22:33.200 --> 22:37.200
EMPTY VASE: IT'S LIKE FIGHTING ALONE
AND THERE'S NO ONE BY MY SIDE.

22:37.280 --> 22:42.600
DAFFODIL: JUST WANT YOU TO KNOW
THAT AT LEAST YOU GOT ME.

22:55.280 --> 22:56.200
Ruethai,

22:59.080 --> 23:00.800
I've been looking all over for you.

23:02.440 --> 23:03.720
Are you all right, Ruethai?

23:10.240 --> 23:11.960
You can tell me everything.

23:13.480 --> 23:15.120
You're my best friend.

23:16.120 --> 23:18.040
I can do anything for you, Ruethai.

23:26.480 --> 23:28.760
If you could be Suer for me,
that'd be nice, right?

23:30.560 --> 23:31.560
Of course, Ruethai,

23:31.640 --> 23:33.120
-I can be anythi--
-Ruethai.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.520
I'm sorry.

23:42.040 --> 23:43.040
I was wrong.

23:45.360 --> 23:46.880
Please give me another chance.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.160
RULES OF THIPNAREEWITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NO. 094

24:20.240 --> 24:22.200
BOYS AND GIRLS BEING TOGETHER IN PRIVATE

24:22.280 --> 24:24.280
IS CONSIDERED THE MOST SERIOUS OFFENSE.

24:24.360 --> 24:27.520
These are the students
who are on the "Shameful List."

24:30.560 --> 24:34.040
Dear students, we have found that

24:34.120 --> 24:37.400
there are some students
who are breaking tradition

24:37.480 --> 24:39.640
and not complying with the school's rules.

24:40.560 --> 24:45.000
So, it's necessary for me
to exercise stricter measures.

24:46.160 --> 24:49.160
I'm doing this out of good intention.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.400
From now on,

24:50.880 --> 24:54.320
the girls will study
at this building only.

24:54.960 --> 24:58.960
And the boys will study
at the building over there.

25:01.600 --> 25:03.400
We're just here to study.

25:07.000 --> 25:13.640
There are some students
that I'll have to take away their phones.

25:13.720 --> 25:16.800
Teachers, please.

25:33.440 --> 25:36.600
Hey, you two, keep your distance!

25:38.440 --> 25:41.520
Or I'll have to make separate paths
for the boys and the girls.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.880
Hello, teacher.

25:56.960 --> 25:58.000
Hello.

26:05.920 --> 26:07.000
Teacher.

26:07.600 --> 26:11.120
I'm afraid that you'll be tired
so I bought you this drink.

26:20.440 --> 26:21.720
Why are you following me?

26:23.320 --> 26:26.280
How is it? Is it working, my plan to peek?

26:32.400 --> 26:35.000
When reading the messages
that people send to each other,

26:35.080 --> 26:37.520
sometimes I feel dazzled.

26:37.600 --> 26:39.600
I don't know if you feel the same.

26:41.040 --> 26:43.880
There's nothing interesting,
only nonsense.

26:45.320 --> 26:46.400
Well, that's true.

26:47.440 --> 26:48.960
But it's a pity.

26:49.040 --> 26:52.880
People are starting to realize
that you're on this app too.

26:54.040 --> 26:56.400
I don't really care
about the app that much.

26:57.040 --> 26:59.280
Anyhow, I'll find a way

26:59.360 --> 27:02.120
to separate the boys and the girls.

27:03.080 --> 27:04.680
I believe so.

27:15.640 --> 27:16.720
Teacher.

27:16.800 --> 27:20.800
I think there's a strange noise
coming from this room.

27:33.760 --> 27:34.760
Hey,

27:34.840 --> 27:37.440
what are you guys doing?

27:37.520 --> 27:40.320
What are you doing?

27:40.400 --> 27:42.520
I told you to stay away
from each other, didn't I?

27:42.600 --> 27:43.680
What are you doing?

27:55.520 --> 27:56.560
Punjan, let's go.

28:19.440 --> 28:21.840
I have bad news to announce.

28:22.560 --> 28:24.360
Ruethai has passed away.

28:24.920 --> 28:27.640
She went to get an abortion,
but she lost too much blood.

28:29.240 --> 28:31.800
And the doctor couldn't save her life.

28:32.760 --> 28:34.840
I'm so sorry, Naruemol.

29:06.240 --> 29:08.760
Do you have any explanation, Ms. Naruemol?

29:08.840 --> 29:13.280
I was trying to protect the students
from immoral things.

29:13.360 --> 29:16.120
They just didn't know yet
what they'd have to face.

29:16.720 --> 29:17.880
They did face… this.

29:22.040 --> 29:25.360
Punjan and Namnueng were tutoring,

29:25.440 --> 29:27.800
and an eraser fell on the floor,

29:27.880 --> 29:30.080
so Namnueng bent over to get it.

29:31.760 --> 29:33.240
Headmaster, do you believe those kids?

29:34.280 --> 29:35.960
I didn't see it so I don't know.

29:37.320 --> 29:39.480
But one thing that I know is

29:39.560 --> 29:42.440
Punjan's head is cut and needs patching.

29:42.520 --> 29:44.840
And their parents might sue the school.

29:48.840 --> 29:50.320
Ms. Naruemol,

29:50.960 --> 29:54.840
for the sake of our school,
I have to fire you.

29:55.560 --> 29:56.480
What?

29:58.040 --> 30:00.800
The incident that happened,
I'll help clear it up.

30:01.480 --> 30:04.400
But Ms. Naruemol,
you must leave immediately.

30:05.760 --> 30:08.200
If I leave, what about the school?

30:08.680 --> 30:11.680
The school will turn co-ed

30:11.760 --> 30:13.360
like it's supposed to be.

31:10.560 --> 31:12.400
DAFFODIL: DON'T FORGET,
A VASE MAKES A FLOWER MORE BEAUTIFUL.

31:12.480 --> 31:14.280
EMPTY VASE: YOU HAVE FEELINGS FOR SOMEONE?

31:15.640 --> 31:18.920
EMPTY VASE: IT'S LIKE FIGHTING ALONE
AND THERE'S NO ONE BY MY SIDE.

31:19.000 --> 31:22.960
DAFFODIL: JUST WANT YOU TO KNOW
THAT AT LEAST YOU GOT ME.

31:29.960 --> 31:32.160
Dear students,

31:32.720 --> 31:39.640
Today, I have Ms. Naruemol here
to say goodbye to you all before leaving.

31:41.480 --> 31:44.160
So I'd like you all to pay attention.

31:45.720 --> 31:49.880
Especially since Ms. Naruemol
has been with us for a very long time,

31:51.840 --> 31:56.000
so she must have a very good point of view
to share with us.

31:58.120 --> 31:59.400
Please.

32:00.280 --> 32:01.520
Thank you.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.040
Dear students,

32:07.880 --> 32:11.800
today, as our school has so many changes,

32:13.200 --> 32:19.200
I'd like the girls to maintain
being graceful, traditional ladies,

32:20.200 --> 32:23.480
and the boys to stay away from the girls.

32:24.600 --> 32:30.520
And when the day that the door opens,
you'll find happiness and safety.

32:44.960 --> 32:46.040
Students.

32:48.240 --> 32:50.280
When that day comes,

32:50.360 --> 32:54.920
you'll find happiness
in the form of family.

32:55.720 --> 33:01.520
I'd like you to maintain
being graceful, traditional ladies.

33:11.720 --> 33:12.720
Empty Vase.

33:13.320 --> 33:14.480
Daffodil.

33:18.040 --> 33:19.920
I understand everything now.

33:21.440 --> 33:22.640
Understand what?

33:23.600 --> 33:25.600
I don't only admire you.

33:26.920 --> 33:29.200
But truthfully,
I might be in love with you.

33:29.800 --> 33:30.760
Love?

33:33.440 --> 33:34.880
I'm telling the truth.

33:37.840 --> 33:38.960
Shameful!

33:40.000 --> 33:41.440
We're ladies.

33:42.160 --> 33:44.520
But love is the feeling of warmth,

33:45.120 --> 33:48.480
happiness, and intimacy.

33:49.040 --> 33:52.960
Do you know I feel warm
every time I'm near you?

33:53.440 --> 33:56.760
And how about you? Do you feel the same?

33:57.840 --> 33:59.840
You're my best friend.

34:01.080 --> 34:03.080
I can do anything for you.

34:06.760 --> 34:10.400
Naruemol, please open your heart to love.

34:10.480 --> 34:13.880
Love is never wrong.
Only the person who does it is wrong.

34:27.520 --> 34:31.760
Love, whatever it looks like,
is still love, isn't it?

34:32.480 --> 34:38.280
I know that you're tired of everything
that you've done but no one sees it.

34:39.639 --> 34:41.120
But I do see it.

34:42.920 --> 34:47.320
It's like fighting alone
and there's no one by my side.

34:48.159 --> 34:53.000
Just want you to know
that at least you got me.

37:48.880 --> 37:53.880
Subtitle translation by:
Tanada Hantaweewatana
